    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e630222c957618ec784fa2c7cb01c43e.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e630222c957618ec784fa2c7cb01c43e.webm?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e630222c957618ec784fa2c7cb01c43e.mp4?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/01143211abd7594653de4c37d15efbb3.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture this: you're a penguin. Life at the North Pole? Freezing. Dull. Zero prospects (especially with the ladies). Time to break free! Find some actual fun, like in good old YetiSports!<br>Your tools? A best bear buddy... and a bat. What could go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/a79f971050d571780b42bd314eca149f.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/a79f971050d571780b42bd314eca149f.webm?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/a79f971050d571780b42bd314eca149f.mp4?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/00d2bcf9e274e610aedd282ffa3a293b.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From scorching deserts to a moose butt - this ain't your average penguin vacation. Bounce off bewildered seals, become a snowball of doom, hitch a ride on a whale, and surf on giant mushrooms. Successfully navigate a lake? Bonus points! Moose-back riding? Definitely a thing. Impale yourself on a pine tree? Probably. All for love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/230e2a525156bdae73e176b8dd717579.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/230e2a525156bdae73e176b8dd717579.webm?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/230e2a525156bdae73e176b8dd717579.mp4?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/fe21638c3c4896906b8e6811b9e52ad5.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is an option! Because..\u00a0You. Will. Always. Fail. Hilariously.\u00a0You'll get eaten by piranhas, become a moose's new hat, get stuck in a tree, and possibly abducted by a creepy green dude. But hey, at least you'll fail in style. The real question is: how far can you get before you fail spectacularly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e4a2d9730c513affdc0390c203acfee7.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e4a2d9730c513affdc0390c203acfee7.webm?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e4a2d9730c513affdc0390c203acfee7.mp4?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/eaff02282b4a694da45fd3f6b3a1d21a.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who needs fish when you have rocket-powered frying pans and the freakin' Infinity Gauntlet? Pick your bat - from humble frying pan to the Eiffel Tower, a trusty club, or the ultimate power glove. Boost your launch power, flight, bounce, and max speed. Prepare for penguin-launching mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/b9fb71584c65feb267c8f214f9673ef0.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/b9fb71584c65feb267c8f214f9673ef0.webm?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/b9fb71584c65feb267c8f214f9673ef0.mp4?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/5289e0f0901258f5ae11c97430b63b51.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your quest for better life you'll even reach the freakin' space. So yeah, we say this game IS about space! It's beautiful. (And a great place to launch a penguin.) Your bear buddy's skills and your epic bat collection will get you there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/bce270f3c06c06c648de854c1fb9ca9b.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/bce270f3c06c06c648de854c1fb9ca9b.webm?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/bce270f3c06c06c648de854c1fb9ca9b.mp4?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/5e40e5439e8b420193a32ceaa67bc238.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you're the ultimate penguin launcher? Prove it. Endless replayability, global leaderboards - compete with friends and foes. Brag about your distance, your style, your collection of ludicrous bats.\u00a0Dominate the leaderboards. Become a legend. Or at least, a slightly less unsuccessful penguin launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e630222c957618ec784fa2c7cb01c43e.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e630222c957618ec784fa2c7cb01c43e.webm?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e630222c957618ec784fa2c7cb01c43e.mp4?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/01143211abd7594653de4c37d15efbb3.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture this: you're a penguin. Life at the North Pole? Freezing. Dull. Zero prospects (especially with the ladies). Time to break free! Find some actual fun, like in good old YetiSports!<br>Your tools? A best bear buddy... and a bat. What could go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/a79f971050d571780b42bd314eca149f.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/a79f971050d571780b42bd314eca149f.webm?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/a79f971050d571780b42bd314eca149f.mp4?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/00d2bcf9e274e610aedd282ffa3a293b.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From scorching deserts to a moose butt - this ain't your average penguin vacation. Bounce off bewildered seals, become a snowball of doom, hitch a ride on a whale, and surf on giant mushrooms. Successfully navigate a lake? Bonus points! Moose-back riding? Definitely a thing. Impale yourself on a pine tree? Probably. All for love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/230e2a525156bdae73e176b8dd717579.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/230e2a525156bdae73e176b8dd717579.webm?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/230e2a525156bdae73e176b8dd717579.mp4?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/fe21638c3c4896906b8e6811b9e52ad5.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is an option! Because..\u00a0You. Will. Always. Fail. Hilariously.\u00a0You'll get eaten by piranhas, become a moose's new hat, get stuck in a tree, and possibly abducted by a creepy green dude. But hey, at least you'll fail in style. The real question is: how far can you get before you fail spectacularly?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/e4a2d9730c513affdc0390c203acfee7.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=35