a great place to launch a penguin.) Your bear buddy's skills and your epic bat collection will get you there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/bce270f3c06c06c648de854c1fb9ca9b.poster.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/bce270f3c06c06c648de854c1fb9ca9b.webm?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/bce270f3c06c06c648de854c1fb9ca9b.mp4?t=1751979355\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3697340/extras/5e40e5439e8b420193a32ceaa67bc238.avif?t=1751979355\" width=600 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you're the ultimate penguin launcher? Prove it. Endless replayability, global leaderboards - compete with friends and foes. Brag about your distance, your style, your collection of ludicrous bats.\u00a0Dominate the leaderboards. Become a legend. Or at least, a slightly less unsuccessful penguin launcher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "short_description": "Launch a penguin across the globe! Whack, bounce, and soar through crazy obstacles in this fun physics-based arcade game, inspired by the legendary YetiSports! Escape the North Pole and find love - or just keep failing hilariously.",
